  "result": "I fixed it: accepting an invitation now refuses links that an admin has revoked. `acceptInvitation` in `src/server/services/invitation-service.ts` already turned away links that were used or expired. It never looked at `revokedAt`, so a cancelled link still created a membership. I added that check before the expiry check, and it throws \"That invitation has been revoked\". I haven't run the test suite.\n\nThis also closes the same hole for resent invitations: a resend revokes the old invite and mints a new one, so the original link kept working until now.",
